  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h3>01. The context</h3>\n          <p><strong>Definition of the need</strong></p>\n          <p>When <strong>Moé Poké</strong> opened its first point of sale, it was looking for a <strong>digital solution </strong>that <strong>could be</strong> easily <strong data-wg-splitted>duplicated</strong>. Its choice fell on an <strong>intuitive </strong>and<strong> open </strong>cash register system and an <a href=\"/en/blog/benefits-of-online-ordering-for-restaurants\"><strong>online ordering</strong></a> that matched his ambition.</p>\n          <h3>02. The interview</h3>\n          <p><strong>Watch the video</strong></p>\n          <p>Alain and Antoine, co-founders of Moé Poké, present the benefits of Innovorder's chosen digital solutions: IO Caisse and IO Web.</p>\n          <p>Discover the interview of Alain &amp; Antoine, co-founders of the company specialized in Poké Bowl!</p>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v4xssWQQcxE\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h4>What were their issues?</h4>\n          <p>Moé Poké wanted a <strong>connected checkout system</strong> that could easily track the company's growth goals.</p>\n          <h4>Why did you choose Innovorder?</h4>\n          <p>Innovorder offers restaurant owners a <strong>\"plug and play\" software suite</strong>. It can be easily deployed on other points of sale and is easy to learn.</p>\n          <p>Moreover, the Innovorder cash register is <strong>intuitive</strong>, <strong>flexible</strong> and <strong>complete</strong>.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1000pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f2fcfc59192819fde6_moe%20poke.jpeg\"></div>\n          </figure>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Moé Poké",
